# The Independent route on the open channel (docs/FINALE.md, "The lock"; docs/DIALOGUE.md, "The
# finale's commit"): said on air without a name, from any radio that can call. Every faction hears
# that somebody said it (a rumour on the roads), never who. The finale decides who may commit.

conv finale.route.independent
for radio:open
when finale:open & route:none
topic "I want to say something about the cure."
always
prio quest
voice plain

node start
  say Open channel. Go ahead, whoever you are. Half the Zone has a set on tonight, waiting to hear who the cure is going to belong to.
  > @all This is nobody. It goes to everyone. -> card
  > @off Never mind. Out. -> hub

node card confirm
  say Think before you say it. Every faction listens to this channel. They'll all hear that somebody said it. Not who. Just that somebody has, and that they're nobody's now.
  > @say Say it on air: it goes to everyone. -> said   do commit:indep
  > @off2 No. Not yet. Out. -> hub

node said public
  say This is nobody. The cure goes to everyone. No crates, no lists.
  say Heard you, nobody. {here} heard you, anyway, and so did every set from here to the line.
  do rumour:"Someone on the open channel says the cure goes to everyone. No crates, no lists."@12
  > @out Out. -> hub
